    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "INTRODUCTION\r\nWelcome to Rock Paper Tuition (\u201CApp,\u201D \u201Cwe,\u201D
    \u201Cour,\u201D \u201Cus\u201D). This Privacy Policy outlines how Rextech Studios
    Private Limited collects, uses, protects, and shares user data when you or your
    child use our app. By accessing our app, you agree to the collection and use
    of information as described in this policy.\r\n\r\nOur app is designed to provide
    an interactive learning experience for children upto the age of 15. While we
    strive for accuracy and a safe user experience, there may be occasional bugs,
    content inaccuracies, or unintended misleading content. However, we assure you
    that such occurrences are unintentional.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nINFORMATION WE COLLECT\r\nWhen
    you use Rock paper tuition, we may ask you to provide your personal data to us.
    For transparency purposes, we explain in detail what personal data we collect
    and have access to, the purposes for which we use them, and legal bases on which
    we rely when processing your personal data. We comply with data minimisation
    principles. This means that we collect only a minimal amount of personal data
    that is necessary for your use of Rock paper tuition. We use your personal data
    for limited, specified and legitimate purposes explicitly mentioned in this Privacy
    Policy. We do not repurpose your personal data. This means that we do not use
    it for any purposes that are different from the purposes for which your personal
    data was provided. Below, you can find an overview of the types of personal data
    that we collect, the purposes for which we use it, and the legal bases on which
    we rely when processing it.\r\nWe collect both personal and non-personal data
    to improve user experience and app functionality.\r\n\r\n\r\nPersonal Data\r\nWe
    collect the following information during account registration or login:\r\n\u2705
    Full Name\r\n\u2705 Email Address\r\n\u2705 Phone Number\r\n\u2705 Age\r\n\r\n\u2705
    Address\r\n\r\n\r\nThese details help us:\r\n\r\nCreate user accounts and profiles\r\n\r\nTrack
    user progress and personalize learning\r\n\r\nProvide customer support and account
    recovery\r\n\r\nSend notifications related to the App\r\n\r\n\r\nNon-Personal
    Data\r\nWe automatically collect non-personal data to improve app performance,
    including:\r\n\U0001F4CC Device Information (OS, device model, screen resolution)\r\n\U0001F4CC
    App Usage Data (Levels played, time spent, scores, progress)\r\n\U0001F4CC Interactions
    & Click Patterns (Game performance, user activity)\r\n\U0001F4CC IP Address (For
    security and fraud prevention)\r\n\r\nThis data helps us enhance the app, fix
    bugs, and optimize content.\r\n\r\n\r\nChildren's Data & Parental Consent\r\nSince
    our app is designed for children, we take measures to ensure the privacy and
    security of their data. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children
    under 13 without parental consent. Parents can review, modify, or delete their
    child\u2019s data by contacting us at info@rextechstudios.com.\r\n\r\nAnalytics
    data\r\n When you use the Apps downloaded from Google Play Store, we use our
    third-party analytics service providers, including Firebase (https://firebase.google.com)
    offered by Google, Google Analytics, and AppsFlyer, which automatically collect
    the following technical personal and non-personal data from you:\r\n\r\nIP address;\r\n\r\nNumber
    of sessions;\r\n\r\nSession duration;\r\n\r\nRetention;\r\n\r\nEvents;\r\n\r\nInstall
    source; and\r\n\r\nIDFA.\r\n\r\nWe use such data to:\r\n\r\nAnalyse the technical
    aspects of your use of the Apps;\r\n\r\nOptimise the Apps for your needs;\r\n\r\nPrevent
    fraud and abuse of the Apps;\r\n\r\nEnsure the security of the Apps; and\r\n\r\nServe
    you relevant ads.\r\n\r\nWe keep such data as long as it is necessary for its
    purposes, but no longer than 1 year. The legal bases that we rely on when processing
    the above-mentioned data are \u201Cpursuing our legitimate business interests\u201D
    (i.e., to analyse, grow, and protect KLA) and \u201Cyour consent\u201D.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLEGAL
    BASES FOR THE PROCESSING\r\n There are some legal bases for the processing of
    your personal information and we count on them to process your personal information.
    We use the main four bases to process your personal information: consent, contract,
    legal obligation, and legitimate interest.\r\n\r\nConsent - your clear agreement
    to the processing of your personal information for a specific purpose.\r\n\r\nContract
    - the legal reason for the processing of your personal information necessary
    for us to perform a contract to which you are a party or in order to take steps
    at your request prior to entering into a contract.\r\n\r\nLegal Obligations -
    the legal reason for the processing of your personal information necessary for
    compliance with a legal obligation to which we are subject.\r\n\r\nLegitimate
    Interests - the legal reason why the processing of your data is necessary which
    is based on the legitimate interests or the legitimate interests of a third party,
    provided those interests are not outweighed by your rights and interests and
    those interests have a specific purpose, they are necessary, and they are balanced.\r\n\r\nApplicable
    laws indicate other legal grounds for the processing and when they are applicable
    we will count on such grounds.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCONSENT RULE AND INTERRELATION
    WITH OTHER LEGAL GROUNDS \r\nIf you have given consent to the processing of your
    data you can freely withdraw such consent at any time by contacting us. If you
    do withdraw your consent, and if we do not have another legal basis for the processing
    of your data, then we will stop the processing of the personal information and
    will delete in specific situations, including in case if you request the deletion
    of your personal information and we are obliged to delete your personal information
    according to the applicable law. If we have another legal basis for the processing
    of your data, then we will continue to do so, subject to your legal interests
    and rights.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOUR RESPONSIBILITIES\r\n When we process personal
    information, we have obligations according to the applicable laws. We act as
    a data controller when we determine the purposes and means of the processing
    of your personal information. As a data processor, we process personal information
    on behalf of the controller\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW WE USE INFORMATION\r\nWe use collected
    data to:\r\n\u2705 Enhance user experience and personalize learning\r\n\u2705
    Track progress and adjust difficulty levels\r\n\u2705 Sync data across devices
    for seamless learning\r\n\u2705 Respond to support requests and account recovery\r\n\u2705
    Analyze usage trends to improve content\r\n\u2705 Ensure security and prevent
    fraud\r\n\r\n\U0001F534 We DO NOT sell or rent your data to third parties.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAGE
    LIMITATIONS \r\nhttps://firebase.google.com/support/privacy We do not knowingly
    contact or do business with children under 15 (thirteen) years of age or such
    greater age required in your country to register for or use our services. The
    services are aimed at parents, guardians, or legal representatives of children.
    If a parent, guardian, or legal representative becomes aware that a child under
    the age of 13(thirteen) has attempted to contact and/or do business with us,
    please send us an email at support@rockpapertuition.com so that we may rectify
    the situation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCONTENT DISCLAIMER\r\nWhile our App is designed
    for educational purposes, please note:\r\n\r\nNot NCERT-Specific: Content is
    not solely based on the NCERT syllabus and includes additional academic and general
    knowledge topics.\r\n\r\nPossible Errors: Despite our best efforts, there may
    be mistakes in content or bugs in the app.\r\n\r\nNo Guaranteed Academic Success:
    We do not guarantee improved school performance or exam scores.\r\n\r\nNot Liable
    for Misinterpretations: Some content may unintentionally mislead children, but
    this is never intentional.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCONTACT WITH US\r\n\r\nWhen you contact
    us by email or by using the contact form available on the Website, we collect
    your name, email address, and any information that you decide to provide us in
    your message. We use your personal data to respond to your enquiries and provide
    you with the requested information. The legal bases that we rely on when processing
    such personal data are \u201Cpursuing our legitimate business interests\u201D
    (i.e., to grow and promote Rock paper tuition) and \u201Cyour consent\u201D (for
    optional personal data that you decide, at your sole discretion, to provide us).
    We keep such data  until you stop communicating with us.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nADD POLICY
    & MONETIZATION\r\nChild-Safe Ads: We partner with verified ad networks to ensure
    compliance with global standards.\r\n\r\nNo Behavioral Tracking of Children:
    Ad networks are restricted from tracking child users.\r\n\r\nIn-App Purchases:
    Some features require a one-time payment or subscription. Parental controls apply.\r\n\r\nUsers
    can opt out of personalized ads by adjusting device settings or contacting us.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCOMMENTS\r\n
    When you leave a comment under one of our blog posts available on the Website,
    we collect your name, website, and any information that you decide to provide
    us with in your comment. We use such information to feature your comment and
    ensure the security of the Website. The legal basis on which we rely is \u201Cpursuing
    our legitimate business interests\u201D (i.e., to maintain, grow and promote
    Rock paper tuition). We keep such data as long as your comment stays on the Website.
    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nINTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & COPYRIGHT\r\nAll content within the app,
    including data, sounds, images, code, UI/UX, and game logic, is the exclusive
    property of Rextech Studios Private Limited.\r\n\r\n\U0001F6AB No third party
    has the right to copy, modify, or distribute our assets without permission.\r\n\u2705
    We DO NOT use copyrighted content from external sources\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUSER RESPONSIBILITIES\r\nBy
    using our App, you agree:\r\n\u2714\uFE0F Not to misuse accounts or attempt to
    reverse-engineer the App.\r\n\u2714\uFE0F Not to upload offensive, illegal, or
    harmful content.\r\n\u2714\uFE0F To use the app responsibly and report issues
    if found.\r\n\r\nViolation of these rules may result in account suspension.\r\n\r\n\r\nDATA
    RETENTION & DELETION\r\n\r\nWe retain personal data only for as long as necessary
    to fulfill its intended purpose.\r\n\r\nIf you delete your account, all personal
    data will be permanently removed within 30 days.\r\n\r\nNon-personal analytics
    and usage data may be retained for up to 12 months to improve the app and enhance
    user experience.\r\n\r\nCertain transaction or legal data may be retained as
    required by applicable laws.\r\n\r\n\U0001F4E7 To request data deletion or manage
    preferences, contact us at [Insert Contact Email].\r\n\r\n\r\nDATA SHARING &
    THIRD-PARTY SERVICES\r\n\r\nWe use third-party services for authentication, analytics,
    and cloud storage:\r\n\U0001F539 Google Firebase \u2013 User authentication,
    analytics, crash reports\r\n\U0001F539 Google Analytics \u2013 Usage monitoring
    and improvement\r\n\U0001F539 AppsFlyer \u2013 Marketing performance tracking\r\n\r\nThird-party
    partners must comply with data protection laws.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSECURITY MEASURES\r\nWe
    take strict precautions to protect your data:\r\n\u2714\uFE0F Encryption of stored
    data\r\n\u2714\uFE0F Access restrictions (only authorized personnel)\r\n\u2714\uFE0F
    Secure cloud storage with multi-layered protection\r\n\r\n\u26A0\uFE0F No system
    is 100% secure. Users should ensure strong passwords and device security.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSENSITIVE
    DATA\r\n We do not collect or have access to any special categories of personal
    data (\u201Csensitive data\u201D) from you, unless you decide, at your own discretion,
    to provide such data to us. Sensitive data refers to your health, religious and
    political beliefs, racial origins, membership of a professional or trade association,
    or sexual orientation.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFEEDBACK\r\nIf you contact us, we may
    keep records of any questions, complaints, recommendations, or compliments made
    by you and the response. Where possible, we will de-identify your personal data
    (i.e., we will remove all personal data that is not necessary for keeping such
    records).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCOOKIES\r\nOur website and app use cookies and similar
    tracking technologies to enhance user experience, improve functionality, and
    analyze app performance. A cookie is a small text file stored on your computer
    or mobile device when you visit a website or use an app. Cookies typically contain
    a unique identifier that helps recognize your device and may store user preferences
    or other data.\r\n\r\nWe use cookies for the following purposes:\r\n\r\nEssential
    Cookies \u2013 Required for app functionality and security.\r\n\r\nAnalytics
    Cookies \u2013 Help us track user interactions and improve performance.\r\n\r\nPersonalization
    Cookies \u2013 Store user preferences to enhance the experience.\r\n\r\nUsers
    can manage or disable non-essential cookies through their device or browser settings.
    However, disabling cookies may impact certain features of the app.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBUG
    REPORTING & FEEDBACK\r\nTo report bugs, content mistakes, or technical issues,
    please contact:\r\n\U0001F4E7 info@rextechstudios.com\r\n\U0001F4CD AVGC-XR ARENA\r\n\r\n8
    th floor\r\n\r\nVismaya\r\n\r\nInfopark\r\n\r\nKochi\r\n\r\nYour feedback helps
    us improve the app! \U0001F680\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIN-APP PURCHASES \r\nOur apps may
    contain in-app purchases (IAP\u2019s) or Subscriptions.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nADVERTISING
    \r\nWe may occasionally cross-promote other products of our own within our apps.
    We use Google Admob to provide non-personalized advertisements in some of the
    apps. In such apps, there is a notice which comes at the beginning of the app
    that non-personalized ads will be displayed. Please review their Privacy Policy:
    https://policies.google.com/privacy (https://policies.google.com/privacy)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSOCIAL
    MEDIA\r\n The Platform does not interact with any social media platforms. We
    may provide links to our own social media pages or profiles for the purpose of
    providing support and product information.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYOUR RIGHTS & CHOICES\r\nUsers
    have the right to:\r\n\U0001F539 Access & Review their stored data\r\n\U0001F539
    Correct inaccuracies in personal information\r\n\U0001F539 Request data deletion
    anytime\r\n\U0001F539 Opt-out of targeted ads and marketing emails\r\n\r\nTo
    exercise these rights, contact us at \U0001F4E7 info@rextechstudios.com.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCHANGES
    TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY\r\nWe may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes
    will be:\r\n\U0001F4E2 Posted within the App\r\n\U0001F4E2 Communicated via email
    (if provided)\r\n\r\nContinued use of the App after updates signifies acceptance
    of the revised policy.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCONTACT US\r\nFor any inquiries regarding
    this policy, contact us at:\r\n\r\n\U0001F4CD Rextech Studios Private Limited\r\n\U0001F4E7
    info@rextechstudios.com"
